Additional third-party libraries and downloadable model/voice assets
  Jandal AI depends on third-party Android/Kotlin libraries, local inference runtimes,
  optional speech engines, optional voice packs, and gated model downloads. Source
  dependencies are declared in gradle/libs.versions.toml. Downloadable models and
  voice assets are not distributed by this source repository unless explicitly bundled
  in a release artefact; they remain subject to their upstream model cards, release
  notes, licences, and provider terms.

  See docs/LEGAL_AND_ATTRIBUTION.md for the launch attribution checklist and the
  components that must be reviewed before Play Store release.